### Count jokes - expect 200 and an object with count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes/count
Accept: application/json

### Read jokes - expect 200 and an array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes
Accept: application/json

### Read one joke - expect 200 and an object
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes/14
Accept: application/json

### Update joke likes - expect 200 and the joke object
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes/like/0
Accept: application/json

### Update joke jeers - expect 200 and the joke object
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes/jeer/0
Accept: application/json

### Read a joke that doesn't exist - expect 404 and a message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes/9999
Accept: application/json
